          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem sum_geom_windows {S : Finset ℂ} (m : ℂ → ℝ) (hm : ∀ u ∈ S, 0 ≤ m u) (idx : ℂ → ℕ)\n    {Z0 c E ρ : ℝ} (hZ0 : 0 ≤ Z0) (hc : 0 ≤ c) (hE : 0 ≤ E) (hρ0 : 0 ≤ ρ) (hρ1 : ρ < 1)\n    (hZ : ∀ k : ℕ, ∑ u ∈ S.filter (fun u => idx u = k), m u ≤ Z0 + c * (k + 1)) :\n    ∑ u ∈ S, m u * (E * ρ ^ idx u) ≤ E * (Z0 / (1 - ρ) + c / (1 - ρ) ^ 2) :=",
